  <!-- EN: Burnt -->
  <AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>焦糊不堪的</AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was burnt. The beans were ruined, and the ceremony was an insult to the sacred art of coffee roasting. -->
  <AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}焦糊不堪。咖啡豆被完全浪费，这场仪式简直就是在玷污咖啡烘焙的神圣艺术性。</AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Underwhelming -->
  <AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>效果甚微的</AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was underwhelming. The roasting lacked the care and skill it deserved, leaving the coffee dull and uninspired. -->
  <AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}效果甚微。烘焙过程缺乏应有的细心与技巧，致使咖啡口感平淡且毫无灵感。</AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: Rich -->
  <AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>浓香四溢的</AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was delightful. The beans were roasted beautifully, filling the air with a rich aroma and leaving us feeling renewed. -->
  <AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}浓香四溢。咖啡豆的烘焙相当顺利，空气中弥漫着浓郁的香气，使我们感到精神焕发。</AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: Masterful -->
  <AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>炉火纯青的</AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was masterful! The beans were roasted to perfection, creating an unforgettable communion with the sacred art of coffee. -->
  <AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}炉火纯青。咖啡豆的烘焙非常完美，我们将永远铭记与神圣咖啡艺术间的沟通。</AM_CoffeeRoastingOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  
